{"name":"Sweet chilli feta pasta","permalink":"sweet-chilli-feta-pasta","edit":"https://github.com/The-Silverwood-Institute/Recibase/tree/master/src/main/scala/se/reciba/api/recibase/recipes/SweetChilliFetaPasta.scala","source":null,"description":null,"tagline":null,"notes":["Try to find large bottles of sweet chilli sauce. You can get about a litre for the same price as one of the tiny bottles. This recipe needs quite a bit.","There are basically no quantities. Add what seems right."],"dated_notes":[],"tags":["Quick","Pescatarian","Scales","Low Effort"],"inherited_tags":[],"image":null,"ingredients_blocks":[{"name":null,"ingredients":[{"name":"Pine nuts","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Cashew nuts","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Brazil nuts","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Feta","quantity":"1 block, approx. 200g","prep":"cut into 1cm cubes","notes":null},{"name":"Tuna chunks","quantity":"1 80g tin","prep":"drained","notes":"Optional"},{"name":"Sweet chilli sauce","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Black pepper","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Fusilli","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":"Spaghetti also works well here"}]}],"method":["Boil water and cook the pasta until al dente or softer. Drain and set aside.","Meanwhile, add oil to a large, deep pan along with the pine, cashew and brazil nuts and roast over a high heat until brown.","Remove pan from the heat and allow to cool for a moment. Add half the feta to the pan and melt over a medium heat.","Add the tuna (if used), black pepper and sweet chilli sauce to the pan and warm.","Add the pasta and remaining feta and mix thoroughly.","Serve hot."]}